{"step_index":327,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:39:30Z","thinking":"**Updating the Admin Interface**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `Admin.jsx` file. The goal is to get the login header and dashboard displaying crucial information: a Coral monogram (`GF`), \"Get Into Feed Media Pvt. Ltd.\", \"Growth Agency Command Suite,\" and the specific operational focuses. This update aims to enhance the user experience within the administrative interface.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState } from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport {\\n  BarChart3, BriefcaseBusiness, FileText, KeyRound, LayoutDashboard,\\n  MessageSquare, Pencil, Plus, RefreshCw, Send, ShieldCheck, Sparkles,\\n  Trash2\\n} from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\n\\nconst API_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || \\\"http://localhost:5000\\\";\\n\\nconst contentTypes = [\\n  { key: \\\"services\\\", label: \\\"Services\\\", title: \\\"title\\\", subtitle: \\\"description\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"caseStudies\\\", label: \\\"Work & Results\\\", title: \\\"brand\\\", subtitle: \\\"result\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"testimonials\\\", label: \\\"Testimonials\\\", title: \\\"name\\\", subtitle: \\\"role\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"blogPosts\\\", label: \\\"Blog Posts\\\", title: \\\"title\\\", subtitle: \\\"category\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"careers\\\", label: \\\"Careers\\\", title: \\\"title\\\", subtitle: \\\"team\\\" }\\n];\\n\\nfunction emptyItem(type) {\\n  if (type === \\\"services\\\") return { title: \\\"\\\", description: \\\"\\\", icon: \\\"Globe2\\\", points: \\\"\\\" };\\n  if (type === \\\"caseStudies\\\") return { brand: \\\"\\\", result: \\\"\\\", metric: \\\"\\\", channel: \\\"\\\", detail: \\\"\\\" };\\n  if (type === \\\"testimonials\\\") return { quote: \\\"\\\", name: \\\"\\\", role: \\\"\\\" };\\n  if (type === \\\"careers\\\") return { title: \\\"\\\", team: \\\"\\\", type: \\\"Full-time\\\", location: \\\"Remote / Indi