{"step_index":338,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:40:45Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough documenting the professional Get Into Feed Agency backend developer command console, API directory, MCP AI status telemetry, and admin management suite.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Agency-Branded Backend Command Portal & Admin Suite\\n\\nWe have added a **professional, branded Agency Developer & Operations Command Portal** directly to the backend (`http://localhost:5000/` and `http://localhost:5000/portal`), clearly showing that this is the official engine of **Get Into Feed Media Pvt. Ltd.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🏛️ Agency Backend Command Portal (`http://localhost:5000/portal`)\\n\\nWhen opening the backend root or portal in the browser, developers, clients, and partners now see an official, branded command console featuring:\\n\\n1. **Official Agency Identity & Headers**:\\n   - **Get Into Feed (GF)** Monogram Logo in Coral & Deep Forest Ink.\\n   - Company: **Get Into Feed Media Pvt. Ltd.**\\n   - Tagline: *Digital Growth Agency Backend Engine*\\n   - Operational Hubs: *Bengaluru • Mumbai • Delhi-NCR • Remote*\\n2. **Live Service Status Badges**:\\n   - 🟢 `API Gateway Active • Port 5000`\\n   - ⚡ `Model Context Protocol (MCP): Connected (7 Tools, 3 Resources)`\\n   - 🗄️ `Live Content Store: Synchronized`\\n3. **Interactive Telemetry Stats**:\\n   - Active Services Count: `6`\\n   - Case Studies Count: `4`\\n   - Inbound Leads Recorded: Dynamic counter from database\\n   - Active MCP Tools: `7`\\n4. **Interactive API Catalog & Direct Links**:\\n   - `/api/site`: Site stats, capabilities, case studies & testimonials\\n   - `/api/leads`: Inbound client lead & growth proposal intake\\n   - `/api/careers`: Job openings & candidate application screening\\n   - `/api/mcp/health`: Model Context Protocol live status\\n   - `/api/mcp/tools`: AI agent tool definitions\\n5. **Quick Launch Buttons**:\\n   - 🌐 [Open Frontend Website (`http://localhost:5173`)](http://localhost:5173)\\n   - 🔒 [Open Admin Command Center (`http://localhost:5173/admin`)](http://localhost:5173/admin)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 Admin Operations Center (`http://localhost:5173/admin`)\\n- Fully branded with **Get Into Feed Agency Operations**.\\n- Inbound client leads & job applications inbox with contact info, budget, and projec\n<truncated 107 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with agency backend command portal details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough with backend portal\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
