{"step_index":340,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:40:50Z","content":"Aapka backend ab **Get Into Feed Agency** ke official branded aur professional look ke sath ready hai! 🏛️✨\n\n---\n\n### 🏛️ Backend Me Kya Kya Show Ho Raha Hai:\n\nJab aap backend ko browser me open karenge (`http://localhost:5000/` ya `http://localhost:5000/portal`):\n\n1. **Official Agency Identity & Branding**:\n   - **Get Into Feed (GF)** Monogram Logo in Coral & Deep Forest Ink.\n   - Company: **Get Into Feed Media Pvt. Ltd.**\n   - Tagline: *Digital Growth Agency Backend Engine & API Command Console*\n   - Operational Hubs: *Bengaluru • Mumbai • Delhi-NCR • Remote*\n\n2. **Live System Telemetry & Status Badges**:\n   - 🟢 `API Gateway Active • Port 5000`\n   - ⚡ `Model Context Protocol (MCP): Connected (7 Tools, 3 Resources)`\n   - 🗄️ `Live Content Store: Synchronized (6 Services, 4 Case Studies)`\n   - 📊 `Total Inbound Client Leads Ingested`\n\n3. **Interactive REST API Directory**:\n   - **`GET /api/site`**: Inspect agency capabilities, stats, and testimonials.\n   - **`POST /api/leads`**: Client proposals intake.\n   - **`GET /api/careers` & `POST /api/applications`**: Talent recruitment funnel.\n   - **`GET /api/admin/overview`**: Agency secure overview.\n\n4. **Model Context Protocol (MCP) AI Hub**:\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/health`**: AI agent health status.\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/tools`**: 7 growth tools catalog.\n   - **`GET /api/mcp/resources`**: Agency credentials & pricing resources.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Links:\n\n1. **Agency Backend Command Portal (Professional Look)**:\n   👉 **[http://localhost:5000/portal](http://localhost:5000/portal)**\n   *(Direct backend root: [http://localhost:5000/](http://localhost:5000/))*\n\n2. **Frontend Main Website (Authentic Human Agency Look)**:\n   👉 **[http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)**\n\n3. **Agency Admin Operations Center**:\n   👉 **[http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin)** *(Access Key: `dev-admin-token`)*\n\nAap [http://localhost:5000/portal](http://localhost:5000/portal) open karke official agency backend portal dekh sakte hain!"}
