{"step_index":352,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:51:01Z","thinking":"**Defining Admin Route**\n\nI've determined that in `App.jsx`, if the route is `/admin`, the correct thing to do is return an `<AdminDashboard />` component. This component will handle the full-screen layout, including its own SaaS top bar, a sidebar, image uploader, and SEO functionalities.\n\n\n**Constructing Admin Layout**\n\nI've scoped out the components needed for the `AdminDashboard`. The layout requires a full-screen SaaS dashboard, including a sidebar with agency branding and navigation, plus a footer for system status. Within the sidebar, I'll need links to Leads, Services, Case Studies, Blog, Testimonials, Careers, and an SEO audit tool. I'm focusing on the component breakdown now.\n\n\n**Designing Admin UI**\n\nI'm focused on the top header bar now: planning to incorporate title with breadcrumbs, quick search, a website visit button, new entry action, and real-time refresh functionality. I am also planning the professional image manager with live previews; which will include URL inputs, image preset pickers, aspect ratio guidance, and clear image functionality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState } from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport {\\n  AlertCircle, ArrowLeft, ArrowUpRight, BarChart3, BriefcaseBusiness,\\n  Check, CheckCircle2, Copy, ExternalLink, Eye, FileText, Filter,\\n  Globe2, Image as ImageIcon, KeyRound, LayoutDashboard, LogOut,\\n  Mail, Megaphone, MessageCircle, MessageSquare, Palette, PenTool,\\n  Pencil, Phone, Plus, RefreshCw, Search, Send, ShieldCheck, Sparkles,\\n  Star, Tag, Trash2, UploadCloud, UsersRound, X, Zap\\n} from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\n\\nconst API_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || \\\"http://localhost:5000\\\";\\n\\nconst contentTypes = [\\n  { key: \\\"services\\\", label: \\\"Services\\\", singular: \\\"Service\\\", icon: Globe2, subtitle: \\\"description\\\", title: \\\"title\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"caseStudies\\\", label: \\\"Work & Cases\\\", singular: \\\"Case Study\\\", icon: Sparkles, subtitle: \\\"result\\\", title: \\\"brand\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"blogPosts\\\", label: \\\"Blog Insights\\\", singular: \\\"Playbook\\\", icon: FileText, subtitle: \\\"category\\\", title: \\\"title\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"testimonials\\\", label: \\\"Testimonials\\\", singular: \\\"Testimonial\\\", icon: Star, subtitle: \\\"role\\\", title: \\\"name\\\" },\\n  { key: \\\"careers\\\", label: \\\"Careers\\\", singular: \\\"Job Opening\\\", icon: BriefcaseBusiness, subtitle: \\\"team\\\", title: \\\"title\\\" }\\n];\\n\\nconst CURATED_IMAGE_PRESETS = [\\n  { label: \\\"Agency Team Hero\\\", url: \\\"/agency-hero.png\\\" },\\n  { label: \\\"Performance Ads & Analytics\\\", url: \\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\\\" },\\n  { label: \\\"UI/UX & Web Engineering\\\", url: \\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507238691740-187a5b1d37b8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\\\" },\\n  { label: \\\"D2C Brands & Product Shoot\\\", url: \\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522335789203-aabd1fc54bc9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\\\" },\\n  { label: \\\"EdTech & Learning Hub\\\", url: \\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524178232363-1fb2b075b655?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\\\" },\\n  { label: \\\"Luxury Real Estate\\\", url: \\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=\n<truncated 60493 bytes>","Description":"\"Update Admin.jsx to a dedicated SaaS CMS with SEO and image management suite\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\OneDrive\\\\Documents\\\\Get into feed\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\Admin.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Updating Admin.jsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Update Admin.jsx with full CMS suite\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
