{"step_index":365,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:52:10Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough documenting the upgraded standalone SaaS Admin CMS dashboard, image management with live previews, and full SEO optimizer with Google SERP snippet preview.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Standalone SaaS Admin Command Center & SEO Management Suite\\n\\nWe have upgraded the **Agency Admin Dashboard** (`http://localhost:5173/admin`) into a dedicated, professional **SaaS CMS Workspace** with zero distracting public website header/footer links, built-in image management, and a live Google Search SERP snippet optimizer.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 What Was Built for the Admin Panel:\\n\\n### 1. 🖥️ Distraction-Free Standalone SaaS Workspace\\n- **No Public Website Links/Header/Footer**:\\n  - When opening `/admin`, the public website header and footer are completely hidden.\\n  - Features a dedicated, dark SaaS sidebar (`#0f172a`), top workspace toolbar with live data refresh, search bar, and \\\"Visit Website ↗\\\" link.\\n- **Agency Identity & Authentication**:\\n  - Branded **Get Into Feed (GF)** Agency Operations login with secret access key.\\n  - MCP AI status indicator (`⚡ MCP AI Server Connected`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. 🖼️ Professional Image Manager with Live Previews\\n- **Direct Image URL Input**: Paste any image URL from Unsplash, CDN, or local assets.\\n- **Agency Preset Quick-Picker**:\\n  - 1-click select presets for *E-Commerce & Skincare*, *UI/UX Engineering*, *EdTech*, *Performance Analytics*, and *Luxury Real Estate*.\\n- **Live Visual Thumbnail Preview**: Instant preview box showing how the image renders on cards, with 1-click remove/replace capability.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. 🔍 Complete In-Depth SEO Optimizer Suite\\n- **Custom Meta Title**:\\n  - Live character counter (`0 / 60 chars`) with color-coded feedback.\\n- **Custom Meta Description**:\\n  - Live character counter (`0 / 160 chars`) for search snippets.\\n- **Focus Keywords Tag Input**:\\n  - Add commercial keywords for search engine indexing.\\n- **Live Google Search (SERP) Snippet Preview**:\\n  - Renders a live pixel-accurate preview of how the page appears on Google Search results on desktop and mobile (`getintofeed.com > section > slug`, blue title link, green domain, gray description).\\n- **Automated SEO Health Score Gauge**:\\n  - Co\n<truncated 447 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with upgraded Admin CMS and SEO suite details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough with Admin CMS details\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
