{"step_index":367,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:52:14Z","content":"Aapka **Admin Panel** ab ek standalone, ultra-professional **Agency CMS & Operations Workspace** ban chuka hai! 🚀👑\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Admin Panel Me Kya Kya Naya & Professional Add Hua Hai:\n\n#### 1. 🖥️ Zero Distraction — Standalone SaaS Layout:\n- Jab aap `/admin` par hote hain, toh **public website ke header links aur footer bilkul hide** ho jate hain.\n- Aapko ek pure SaaS software (jaise Webflow CMS / Strapi) ka dedicated **Dark Sidebar** (`#0f172a`), top action bar, search bar, aur quick live refresh button milta hai.\n\n#### 2. 🖼️ Professional Image Manager with Live Previews:\n- **Direct Image URL**: Koi bhi image URL paste kar sakte hain.\n- **Agency Preset Quick-Picker**: 1-click me high-quality images select karein (*Performance Analytics, Web UI/UX, D2C Skincare, EdTech, Real Estate*).\n- **Live Image Thumbnail Preview**: Form ke andar hi instant image render hoti hai aur remove/replace ka option rehta hai.\n\n#### 3. 🔍 Complete In-Depth SEO Optimizer Suite:\n- **Meta Title Input**: Live character counter (`0 / 60 chars`) with color indicator.\n- **Meta Description Input**: Live character counter (`0 / 160 chars`) search snippets ke liye.\n- **Focus Keywords Input**: Target keywords add karein.\n- **Live Google Search (SERP) Snippet Preview**: Google par aapka blog ya service page kaisa dikhega (Blue clickable title, green URL, description snippet) uska real-time preview render hota hai!\n- **SEO Health Score (0–100 Gauge)**: Content quality aur meta tags ke basis par automatic score batata hai.\n\n#### 4. 📥 Inbound Client Leads CRM Inbox:\n- Website se aane wali saari client inquiries aur job applications ka clean dashboard.\n- Har lead ke sath **1-Click WhatsApp Button** aur **Direct Email Action** hai jisse aap lead aate hi turant chat start kar sakein.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Admin Panel Ko Abhi Check Karein:\n\n👉 **[http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin)**\n- **Admin Access Key**: `dev-admin-token`\n\nAap [http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin) open karke login karein aur kisi bhi Blog ya Service ke **\"Edit & SEO\"** button par click karke Image aur Live Google SEO Preview test kar sakte hain!"}
