{"step_index":377,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:58:07Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough documenting the full Pro Studio CMS Suite with Visual Markdown Toolbar, live word telemetry, 1-Click AI Growth Copywriting Assistant, Multi-Channel SERP & Social OpenGraph Card Previews, and Inbound Leads CRM with CSV export.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Pro Agency Studio CMS & Advanced SEO Writing Suite\\n\\nWe have upgraded the **Get Into Feed Agency Admin Panel** into a **Full Pro Studio CMS Suite** (`http://localhost:5173/admin`), equipped with rich visual formatting, 1-click AI growth copywriting assistants, and multi-channel search & social card previews.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Pro Studio CMS: What Was Built\\n\\n### 1. ✍️ Pro Visual Markdown & Formatting Toolbar\\n- **Visual Toolbar Buttons**:\\n  - `H2` & `H3` Headings\\n  - `Bold` (`**B**`) & `Italic` (`*I*`)\\n  - `Bullet Lists` & `Numbered Lists`\\n  - `Blockquotes` & 💡 `Key Takeaway Callout Boxes`\\n  - `Links` & `Code Snippets`\\n- **Side-by-Side / Toggle Live Preview**:\\n  - Switch between Raw Markdown editor and rendered typography preview with 1 click.\\n- **Live Content Telemetry Bar**:\\n  - Real-time **Word Counter**, **Character Counter**, and **Estimated Reading Time** (`~X min read`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. ⚡ Built-in 1-Click AI Growth Copywriting Assistant\\nFour specialized agency AI assistants:\\n1. **⚡ High-Converting Playbook Outline**: Generates a structured marketing breakdown with hook, 3 strategy pillars, metrics, and key takeaways.\\n2. **🎯 Smart Meta Title & Description**: Auto-generates click-optimized 55-char title and 150-char description from your draft.\\n3. **🔍 Commercial Keyword Extractor**: Extracts high-intent search queries for SEO metadata.\\n4. **🚀 Schema-Ready FAQs Builder**: Appends structured Q&A blocks to boost Google rich snippet rankings.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. 🌐 Multi-Channel SERP & Social Sharing Previews\\n- **Google Desktop SERP Snippet Preview**: Real-time pixel-accurate rendering of desktop search result.\\n- **Google Mobile SERP Snippet Preview**: Mobile viewport search preview.\\n- **Social OpenGraph Card Preview**: Real-time preview of how the post renders when shared on **WhatsApp, LinkedIn, Twitter/X, and Facebook** (with feature image, title, and domain tag).\\n- **SEO Health Score Gauge (0–100)**: Instant feedback on title length, description prese\n<truncated 619 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with Pro Studio CMS details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough documentation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
