{"step_index":379,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:58:12Z","content":"Aapka **Admin Panel** ab basic textboxes se nikal kar **Full Advance Level Pro Agency Studio CMS** ban chuka hai! 🚀👑🔥\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Pro Level Features Jo Ab Active Hain:\n\n#### 1. ✍️ Pro Visual Markdown & Formatting Toolbar:\n- Ab plain textarea ke badle ek **Pro Toolbar** diya gaya hai:\n  - **Headings**: `H2`, `H3`\n  - **Formatting**: `Bold`, `Italic`, `Bullet List`, `Numbered List`, `Quotes`\n  - 💡 **Key Takeaway Highlight Box**\n  - **Code Blocks & Links**\n- **Live Markdown Preview**: `Edit Raw` aur `Live Preview` me 1-click toggle karke dekh sakte hain ki typography real website par kaisi dikhegi.\n- **Live Content Telemetry**: Real-time **Word Count**, **Character Count**, aur **Estimated Reading Time** (`~2 min read`) calculate hota hai.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. ⚡ 1-Click AI Growth Copywriting Assistant:\nForm ke andar naya **\"AI Copy Assistant\"** tab diya gaya hai:\n1. **⚡ Generate High-Converting Outline**: 1-click me pura structured framework (Problem + 3 Strategy Pillars + Metrics + Takeaways) draft kar deta hai.\n2. **🎯 Smart Meta Title & Description**: Aapke content se automatic click-worthy Google Meta tags generate karta hai.\n3. **🔍 Commercial Keyword Extractor**: High-intent search keywords nikal kar SEO box me daalta hai.\n4. **🚀 Schema-Ready FAQs Builder**: Google rich snippet ranking ke liye automatic Q&A section append karta hai.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. 🌐 Multi-Channel Google SERP & Social Sharing Card Previews:\nSEO Tab me ab 3 alag-alag live previews hain:\n- 🖥️ **Google Desktop Search Preview** (Pixel-accurate Google SERP).\n- 📱 **Google Mobile Search Preview** (Mobile viewport Google result).\n- 💬 **WhatsApp / LinkedIn / Twitter Social Card Preview** (Feature photo, bold headline aur `GETINTOFEED.COM` domain ke sath kaisa dikhega).\n- 📊 **SEO Score Gauge (0–100)**: Real-time grade batata hai.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. 🖼️ Visual Media Library & Presets:\n- Koi bhi direct image URL paste karein ya agency ke **Curated Stock Presets** (*Performance Ads, React Web, D2C Skincare, EdTech, Real Estate*) me se 1-click me select karein.\n- Live image thumbnail preview aur 1-click remove capability.\n\n---\n\n#### 5. 📥 Leads CRM & CSV Export:\n- Inbound inquiries ko filter karein (*Client Proposal, Career Candidate, Blog Comment*).\n- **1-Click WhatsApp Chat (`wa.me`)** with pre-filled greeting message.\n- **1-Click Direct Email**.\n- 📥 **Export to CSV**: Saare client leads ko 1-click me Excel/CSV me download karein.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Abhi Test Karein:\n\n👉 **[http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin)**\n- **Secret Key**: `dev-admin-token`\n\nBlog ya Service ke **\"Edit & SEO\"** button par click karke dekhein — Toolbar, Live Previews aur AI Assistant full pro level par ready hain!"}
